SUMMARY:The Garden Club of Toronto Spring Blooms
DESCRIPTION:For many years the Garden Club of Toronto’s major spring activity was participating with our co-founding partner\, Landscape Ontario\, in the renowned Canada Blooms show held at a succession of landmark Toronto venues in March each year. After Covid\, Canada Blooms was not able to continue\, but that wasn’t going to stop them. Enjoy spectacular floral designs\, award winning plants & flowers from their members’ gardens and live demonstrations every hour. \n\n\n\nThursday\, May 28\, 2026\, 2 to 7 p.m.Admission is FREE \n\n\n\nFor more information visit the Garden Club of Toronto Website.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/the-garden-club-of-toronto-spring-blooms/
LOCATION:ON
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Spring-Blooms-Garden-Club-of-Toronto.jpg
END:VEVENT
